{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-13_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-13","title":"逃离炮火","storyCode":"10-15","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-13_beg.txt","sourceHash":"23669a7a52a1be81afcc47be0b8b45497ef650919c418817179e5c1451912628","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"11-beg"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——D区和E区受到严重损伤，其他区域顶层结构也有不同程度破损！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轻伤十九人，暂时没人重伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，指挥官，我们听了您和那位博士的话，把大部分人提前转移到了安全区域——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，并不安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整个地块都很危险......我们的据点完全暴露在了萨卡兹面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在把这里彻底炸穿，确保我们无处可躲之前，他们是不会罢手的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还有多少时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三十分钟，呃，说不定时间更短一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近的地块年纪都挺大了，以我们之前见过的城防炮的威力，再乘以一个输出极值理论倍数——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不出三十分钟，我们头顶的全部结构层就会被轰烂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知哈默，我们立刻启动列车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"列车？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们应该都见过了，在我们头顶几公里处，有一个车站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为车站已经被萨卡兹占了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们必须把它夺回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今萨卡兹截断了我们通往其他区块的所有渠道，这是我们撤离萨迪恩区的最后希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂，一旦我们离开萨迪恩区，你有方法帮我们避开萨卡兹的视线吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我一直准备着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到下一个站点，会有朋友来帮我们做好伪装和掩护，直到我们成功进入中央区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最大的问题还是，我们能不能安全登上列车——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅，我们目前离城墙多远？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走地下通道的话，很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想试试从下面登上城墙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你是想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会为自救军的撤退争取时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封锁目标地块的全部出口，盯紧车站。我不希望他们再逃进下一个阴沟里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"设置地面活动目标动态追踪。万一他们不死心，想爬到地面上，使用其他载具，那他们就必须直面更猛烈的炮火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加强城墙内部所有节点的防御。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有，修改城防炮的控制口令，确保除我以外，没人能关闭它们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，足够谨慎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军？！您为何会来这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"再过一会，这些恼人的虫豸就再无藏身之地。整个伦蒂尼姆的反抗势力不会再敢轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"更关键的是，不会再有人从我们看不见的暗道里进进出出。外面的公爵部队将只能看到我们筛选过后的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人能再影响我们的工程进度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，这样值得庆祝的时刻，你不欢迎我与你一同迎接吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要再同我开玩笑了，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯？","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你又进步了嘛，这次我们只说了五句话，你就发现了我们不是特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下......虽然殿下不会同你计较，但如果你这副样子被赦罪师的人看见，他们一定会再次向殿下申请，限制你的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯？","speakerId":"avg_npc_062","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧，你说的对，军事委员会不能有两个发号施令的人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我们换一个更舒服的模样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难得，你愿意用王庭会议时的形象来见我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们答应你了，不用逝者的脸，也不再吓唬你和你的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回来得比预定的时间更早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然你帮我们找到了反抗军的窝点，但他们依然可能有其他我没注意到的后路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如你能跟说好的一样，一路跟着他们，直到最后一名反抗军落到我们手中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真以为那个博士能让我们藏那么久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，曼弗雷德，你别忘了，我们不归你管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我冒昧了，请阁下宽恕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也别用这种跟老红眼病说话的语气跟我们说话，早说过了，我们不吃这套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所愿，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你选择提前回到这里，那么，你在地下看到你想看见的了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......那个“魔王”比我们想象的要更坚强一些，不过还远远算不上成熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她呀，她还不知道自己即将面对什么，我们想了解更多的话，至少要等她见一见那位殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你这些话，最好别让赦罪师听见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听见又怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会以为变形者集群的王庭有......摇摆之心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得我们会在乎吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，我们答应你的事已经做完了，剩下的烂摊子，你和血魔自己收拾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了......再有下次的话，给我们挑一个还活着的身份吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，阿米娅和博士已经出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一批自救军战士正在赶往头顶的车站......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快走，都跟上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等战士们成功夺下车站，伤员们和没有战斗力的平民会最先登上列车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白轮先生，麻烦你和医疗干员们一起照顾下行动不便的伤员，大家留意通道两侧的信号灯，不要走散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分指挥部的人会随着伤员和平民一起转移，除了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的人都进入撤退通道了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顶部结构稳定性持续下降！指挥官，你赶紧离开这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要所有人都进了通道，我自然会跟上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二队，汇报情况！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥官，这地下都快待不了人了，真的还会有敌人下来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汇报！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，我们要跟上白轮他们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下？你是说陪着克洛维希娅指挥官一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一种感觉......这种感觉可能她也有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最强大的敌人，或许此刻并不在我们头顶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......城防炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，号角，城防炮又启动了！这一次他们对准的是距离城墙最近的地块，目前来看，轰炸中心不在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但谁都不能保证附近的安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑啊，快跑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的女儿去了哪里......谁看见我的女儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请立刻进入最坚固的建筑物避险——不，用最快的速度远离城墙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......伦蒂尼姆的城防炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照目前的情况来看，要不了多久，炮火就能贯穿地块，甚至破坏最下方的基底结构。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的萨卡兹，他们是不是早就等着这一刻了？他们是准备彻底毁了这座城市吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。他们只启动了少量炮口，打击目标也很明确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是为了消灭我们......和我们的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角，我们该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天跟我们回来的士兵之中，是不是有几位原本就驻守在此的城防军？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫上他们。拿上最好的装备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟他们说——是时候把我们的城墙从萨卡兹手里夺回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往前一点点就到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，别在这里摔倒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......很难说得上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我能懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也犯过大错，信任了不该信任的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，一个多月的时间，我只能逼着自己不要停下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要一停下来，我就......呃，觉得自己很难直视阿米娅的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，仗还没打完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家连喘息的时间都不够，要是我还想着哀悼或者自我怀疑的话，也太奢侈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特先生，你需要帮助吗？我可以帮助你平复情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平复情绪？这也是某种源石技艺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你平时......也会为你的战士做这些心理治疗吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果干员自己觉得有必要的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"别误会，阿米娅是关心大家。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"阿米娅并不想把干员变成无情的战斗机器。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特先生，我让你误会了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，倒也没有，就是觉得源石技艺真的很神奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算生在伦蒂尼姆这样的城市，我没见过的，还是很多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅小姐，谢谢你的好意。不过，我还不想那么快就把刚才那一幕从我的脑子里驱赶出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那接着干活咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干活吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无人机显示，我们头顶的防御结构层......非常厚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能爆破吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能性很低。如果伦蒂尼姆的城防系统能这么轻易就被炸开......呃，我们昨天就该杀进碎片大厦了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你能找到办法。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我相信可露希尔。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，谢谢你对我的信心，这可真是压榨员工的好办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我扫描到了升降梯，只要你们能找到一个合适的缝隙，让我把无人机塞进去，我就能黑到升降梯的控制权......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，首先你们得找一个更大的缝隙，来把自己弄到上面去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你不觉得你应该发个信号，让Misery赶过来吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他有其他任务。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看来我们没法偷懒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本地人先生，麻烦再给我一些灵感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能找到支柱结构，再施加一个超强外力的话，应该能开一条缝出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有人正在迅速接近我们的位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹料到了我们会想办法登墙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"管不了那么多了，我让无人机搭载源石炸药！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，你算好位置，我们再想个办法放大爆炸效果——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫德雷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又见面了，罗德岛的领导人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定要先聊她的事吗？我听说你们的时间很紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以不问你们之间发生了什么。切尔诺伯格和Scout的事......我也同意暂且放到一边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，雇佣兵先生，如果此刻你一定要挡在我们身前，我动手的时候绝不会犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死在那位殿下的继承人手上，对一名雇佣兵来说，也算是一种荣耀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你最好快一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在刚才，我的炸弹已经开始倒计时了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一分钟，我们最多只有一分钟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来拖住赫德雷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。阿米娅小姐，这个雇佣兵交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了支柱的位置。而且，我有个主意，虽然不知道有多牢靠......能成功的话，你和博士抓紧时间登墙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认得你，年轻的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也认得你脸上的表情。你终于知道自己失去了多少，而且正在为自己决策的正当性感到迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迷茫吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，就算有时间，我也不想跟刽子手谈心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看这里——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又是烟雾弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算少了一条能动的胳膊，你这些道具也对我起不了作用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来啊，萨卡兹，朝我砍过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用上你的剑，你的刀，你所有的武器——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想引开我？不算太明智的策略。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缺乏自知之明的孤勇并不能创造奇迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你所有的手下都在这里，你们也无法战胜我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你逃跑的模样越来越狼狈。没有其他人帮你的话，你很快就会流血而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到底，你只是一个工匠......你和你的手下，不过是挥舞着扳手和锤子，就想扛住萨卡兹在战争中淬炼百年的刀剑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向那边的魔王求救吧。让她来处置我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......魔王？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说......什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹......是你们把战火烧到了伦蒂尼姆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，这就是我们之间的战争！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三十秒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，集中能量。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，抓住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特先生，我需要你锁定位置——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵......你看到这个了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又是什么奇怪的障眼法道具？别挣扎了，你骗不过我的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，就是这样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦更用力一些！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......磐蟹？一个机械玩具？你又想靠小伎俩蒙混过去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，它是你们从我身边带走的最重要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来不是孤身战斗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，老比尔又帮了我一次。雇佣兵，也多亏了你的多疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的多疑？你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你利用了我的攻击——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈！你终于看明白了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你砍向我的每一刀，都是通往你们失败的道路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，结构层被赫德雷劈开了一条缝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，瞄准它，炸弹就快炸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三，二，一——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撕开了——这条缝隙足够大！无人机——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"升降梯控制权到手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，你还有力气吗？拉住滑索，我们跟上去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想走——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，还有炸药吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有，你接住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你的帮助，雇佣兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
